      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْتِجٌ</span></b>  The <i>time at which a she-camel,</i> (S,) or <i>a
mare,</i> (K,) <i>brings forth.</i> (S, K.) Ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَتَتِ النَّاقَةُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى مَنْتِجِهَا</span> <i>The she-camel arrived at the time of
her bringing forth.</i> (S.)

